{"unit_id":"popu2do__dsh-call-session#card-zh","repo":"popu2do/dsh-call-session","commit":"aab8d89ad618ab527e8eab54cf866b8f8afef726","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-call-session 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的跨会话协作插件，在宿主中注册黑板、会话查询、单播调用和同级会话创建工具，并提供只读协作画布与会话引用。它可发布和按需检索共享事项、向指定会话派发任务或汇报、创建继承模型配置的同级会话，并查看工作区、会话状态及调用关系。适合需要多个长期会话协作、共享较长产物或观察协作拓扑的 DSH 用户。安装到 DSH profile 后即可使用，黑板默认保存在本机 DSH 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:251","lib/tools-registry.mjs:57","lib/web-telemetry-route.mjs:366"]}
{"unit_id":"popu2do__dsh-call-session#card-en","repo":"popu2do/dsh-call-session","commit":"aab8d89ad618ab527e8eab54cf866b8f8afef726","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-call-session adds cross-session collaboration to DSH Web. Agents share board items, query sessions, send tasks, and create peer sessions. A read-only canvas shows session states and call links; references provide session content without waking targets. Board data is stored locally by default.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:251","lib/tools-registry.mjs:57","lib/web-telemetry-route.mjs:366"]}
